<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant Corp cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it downgraded Guidant Corp to neutral from attractive on price.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Guidant closed Friday at 77-7/8.</p>
</text>
